#  If you upload the APK to Firebase Storage instead, paste its public
#  download URL here, e.g.:
#    FIREBASE_APK_URL=https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/…/o/app.apk?alt=media&token=…
#  Then run deploy.bat. (The admin dashboard "Releases" tab can also set a
#  per-release URL — it always wins when present.)
